NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixlog.Store.appendJSONL kind=method
  digest=b3:4e20b17f32d60ce0aa21db59c33b2988fcfe83c0088afb6f617b67da74d26e3a file=neo/internal/automatrixlog/automatrixlog.go range=211:234 lang=go exported=false byte_range=6975:7737
  sig=func (s *Store) appendJSONL(path string, rec Record) error
  doc=appendJSONL appends one record as a single (sealed, when encrypting) JSON\nline. O_APPEND + a single Write makes the line atomically visible (POSIX); a\ntorn write yields an unparseable final line that readJSONL skips (crash-\natomic). The record is bound to its on-disk position via the reconstructed AD.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixlog.Store
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixlog/automatrixlog.go

