NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixlog.Store.readJSONL kind=method
  digest=b3:b531438d53358bc1f6592924941e032c27d0209f61e062a421fafc98c6f41e21 file=neo/internal/automatrixlog/automatrixlog.go range=284:319 lang=go exported=false byte_range=8900:9891
  sig=func (s *Store) readJSONL(path string) []Record
  doc=readJSONL parses a newline-delimited record file, oldest-first, decrypting\neach sealed line under the reconstructed AD (legacy plaintext passes through\nuntil migrated). A line that fails to decrypt or unmarshal (including a\nwrong-key, tampered, or crash-truncated final line) is skipped; the position\ncounter still advances so surviving records stay position-bound.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixlog.Store
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/automatrixlog/automatrixlog.go

